Flash- {{Accel|Cost 5 ()}}
Destroy an opposing 12000 BP or less Spirit. After this effect resolves, put this card face-up on your Removed Zone. If you control any "Terra Dragon" family Spirit with Advent, instead of sending it to the Removed Zone, you can add this card as a pre-advent to it.

 [LV1][LV2] While you control any Spirit with Advent, this Spirit gains an extra Red symbol.

When the Burst condition of this card in Hand is fulfilled, if you have at least one Yellow-only card in your Trash, you can activate this card's Burst. This effect can only be used once per turn.

{{Burst|After your Life is reduced}}
Put a core from the Void to your Life. After this effect resolves, summon this card without paying the cost, and you can set a card with Burst effects from your Hand.

This Brave does not exhaust, and while in Spirit condition, cannot attack nor block.

During Right Brave {{ua|Yellow/Blue}}
The Spirit is unaffected by opposing Yellow/Blue Spirit/Ultimate/Nexus/Magic effects.

During Left Brave {{ha|Purple/White}}
The Spirit is unaffected by opposing Purple/White Spirit/Brave/Nexus/Magic effects.

Flash -  {{Advent|Android & Cost 4 or more|(Either Attack Step)}}
By sending your (Soul Core) to the Trash, stack this from your Hand onto your target Spirit.

[LV1][LV2][LV3] (When Advents/Attacks)
Discard an opposing Burst. Or, return an opposing Spirit/Ultimate to the deckbottom.

[LV2][LV3] {{ha|Red/Purple/Green/Blue}}
This Spirit is unaffected by opposing Red/Purple/Green/Blue Spirit/Brave/Nexus/Magic effects.

While there are four or more cores on one of your Grandwalker Nexuses, this set card is unaffected by opposing effects.

{{Burst|After your Life is reduced}}
{{Burst|After an opposing Spirit's (When Summoned/Advents) effect resolves}}
Destroy an opposing 15000 BP or less Spirit/Ultimate. After this effect resolves, summon this card without paying the cost.

[LV2][LV3][LV4] (When Attacks)
By sending two cores from your Grandwalker Nexuses to the Void, refresh this Spirit.

{{Burst|After Your Life Decreases}}
{{Burst|After an opposing Grand Skill resolves}}
Destroy an opposing 30000 BP or less Spirit/Ultimate. Effects of the destroyed Spirit/Ultimate cannot activate. After this effect resolves, summon this card without paying the cost.

[LV2][LV3][LV4] (When Attacks)
Destroy an opposing Spirit/Ultimate with BP equal or inferior to this Spirit's. Also, if you have a Burst set, you can target and attack an opposing Spirit/Ultimate.

{{Burst|After your Life is reduced}}
{{Burst|After an opposing Grand Skill resolves}}
Send three cores from any opposing Spirits/Ultimates to the Trash. After that effect resolves, summon this card without paying the cost.

[LV2][LV3] (When Attacks)
You can destroy an opposing exhausted Spirit/Ultimate, and when destroys, if your Life is at three or less, send a core from any opposing Life/Spirit/Ultimate to the Void.

{{Burst|After your Spirit is depleted/destroyed by the opponent}}
{{Burst|After an opposing Grand Skill resolves}}
Return an opposing exhausted Spirit/Ultimate to the deckbottom. Also, send an opposing Spirit/Ultimate to the Removed Zone. After this effect resolves, summon this card without paying the cost.

[LV2][LV3] (When Attacks)
When only the opposing Spirit/Ultimate is destroyed by BP comparison, send an opposing Life to the Void, and refresh this Spirit.

{{Burst|After your Spirit/Ultimate is destroyed by the opponent}}
{{Burst|After an opposing Grand Skill resolves}}
Summon this card without paying the cost. Then, if there is any Yellow-only card in your Trash, put a core from the Void each to your Life and to a Grandwalker Nexus you control.

[LV2][LV3] Flash - (Either Attack Step)
Once per turn, by banishing three cards from your decktop, during this turn, an opposing Spirit/Ultimate's BP becomes 1000 BP.

{{Burst|After an opposing Spirit/Ultimate's (When Summoned) effect resolves}}
{{Burst|After an opposing Grand Skill resolves}}
Discard five cards from the opposing decktop. If a Cost 4/7 card is discarded by this effect, summon this card without paying the cost.

[LV1][LV2][LV3] Great Crush (When Attacks)
For each LV this Spirit has, discard five cards from the opposing decktop, and when a card with Burst effects is discarded, destroy an opposing Spirit.

While you control any exactly-named "Kamen Rider Kuuga Titan Form", this card's Change becomes {{Change|cos|Cost 4 ( (Red Core) (Red Core) (Red Core))}}

Flash - {{Change|Cost 6 ( (Red Core) (Red Core))}}
Destroy every opposing Nexus. After this effect resolves, either discard this card or replace one of your Cost 6 or less "Kamen" family Spirits with this card in refreshed condition. If the Spirit is currently battling, continue the battle.

[LV1][LV2][LV3]
This Spirit can't be destroyed by opposing effects.

While you control any exactly-named "Kamen Rider Kuuga Dragon Form", this card's Change becomes {{Change|cos|Cost 4 ( (Red Core) (Red Core) (Red Core))}}

Flash - {{Change|Cost 6 ( (Red Core) (Red Core))}}
Destroy every opposing Spirit with two or more Symbols. After this effect resolves, either discard this card or replace one of your Cost 6 or less "Kamen" family Spirits with this card in refreshed condition. If the Spirit is currently battling, continue the battle.

[LV2] (When Attacks)
Destroy an opposing Brave.

While you control any exactly-named "Kamen Rider Kuuga Pegasus Form", this card's Change becomes {{Change|cos|Cost 4 ( (Red Core) (Red Core) (Red Core))}}

Flash - {{Change|Cost 6 ( (Red Core) (Red Core) (Red Core))}}
Destroy any number of opposing Spirits up to a total of 10000 BP. Effects of Spirits destroyed by this effect can't activate. After this effect resolves, either discard this card or replace one of your Cost 6 or less "Kamen" family Spirits with this card in refreshed condition. If the Spirit is currently battling, continue the battle.

During (Either End Step), you can pay three cost to summon this card from your Trash.

Flash - {{Change|Cost 4 ( (White Core) (Purple Core))}}
Destroy an opposing Cost 6 or less exhausted Spirit. After that effect resolves, either discard this card or replace one of your Cost 6 or less "Kamen" family Spirits with this card in refreshed condition. If the Spirit is currently battling, continue the battle.

Flash - {{ArmDigiv|Rookie/Champion}}
By returning a "Rookie"/"Champion" family Spirit you control to the Hand, pay one cost to summon this card from the Hand.

[LV1][LV2][LV3] (When Summoned/Attacks)
You can discard a card from your decktop. By returning an opposing Spirit with a cost equal or inferior to the discarded card's to the Hand, add the discarded card to your Hand.

[LV2][LV3] {{ha|Purple/White}}
This Spirit is unaffected by opposing Purple/White Spirit/Brave/Nexus/Magic effects.

When you're summoning a "Rookie" family card, the symbol of this card in your Removed Zone is treated as being on the Field, and is also treated as Red/Purple/Green/White/Blue.

Main - {{Accel|Cost 2 ( (God Core))}}
Reveal five cards from your decktop. Add a "Tamer" family Nexus card and an exactly-named "D-Ark" among them to the Hand. Return any remaining cards to the deckbottom in any order. After this effect resolves, put this card face-up onto the Removed Zone.

When any exactly-named "Cell Medal" is put onto your Field, you can return this card from your Trash to the Hand. This effect can only be used once per turn.

{{Burst|After your Spirit is Depleted/Destroyed by the Opponent}}
Ignoring the cost of Braves, destroy two opposing Cost 6 or less Spirits/Ultimates. Or, by discarding six exactly-named "Cell Medal" from your Field, ignoring the cost of Braves, destroy every opposing Cost 9 or less Spirit/Ultimate. After this effect resolves, summon this card without paying the cost.
